    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short  prototype created during the very first stages of developing <i>The Dark Crown: Genesis</i>.<br><br>What\u2019s included in this game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-level dungeon experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early versions of enemy AI and level layout</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic melee combat and dash mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Weapon, 5 Ability (2 Ability Upgrade per ability)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 enemy + 1 &quot;mini&quot; Boss + 1 main Boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard &amp; controller support (basic)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <i>The Dark Crown: Genesis</i>, you are thrown into a dungeon ruled by ancient demonic forces. Equipped with the forbidden Element of Darkness, you must fight through relentless enemies, defeat powerful demon bosses, and claim their weapons and dark powers to forge your path to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can support the development of the &quot;The Dark Crown: Genesis&quot; by purchasing this early prototype.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short  prototype created during the very first stages of developing <i>The Dark Crown: Genesis</i>.<br><br>What\u2019s included in this game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-level dungeon experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early versions of enemy AI and level layout</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic melee combat and dash mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Weapon, 5 Ability (2 Ability Upgrade per ability)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 enemy + 1 &quot;mini&quot; Boss + 1 main Boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard &amp; controller support (basic)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <i>The Dark Crown: Genesis</i>, you are thrown into a dungeon ruled by ancient demonic forces. Equipped with the forbidden Element of Darkness, you must fight through relentless enemies, defeat powerful demon bosses, and claim their weapons and dark powers to forge your path to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can support the development of the &quot;The Dark Crown: Genesis&quot; by purchasing this early prototype.</p>",
    "short_description": "2d, rogue-lite, action platformer, pixel art game. It is about the transition of darkness, which is the 6th and last main element, to humanity. A small early game made before The Dark Crown: Genesis was rebuilt from scratch.",
